# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#   BRAINY AI — Production Environment Variables (.env.example)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and configure for your local or cloud deployment:
# cp .env.example .env

# ── 1. Flask Backend & Web Sanctuary Gateway ──────────────────────────
PORT=5000
FLASK_SECRET_KEY=generate_a_secure_random_hex_key_here
FRONTEND_URL=https://brainyai.cenai.workers.dev
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://brainyai.cenai.workers.dev,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000

# ── 2. Next.js Frontend Configuration ────────────────────────────────
# Point Next.js to your deployed Railway Flask backend (or localhost:5000 in dev)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://brainyai-production.up.railway.app

# ── 3. Administrator Access Control Allowlist ────────────────────────
# Comma-separated admin IDs, usernames, and emails permitted to access /admin
ADMIN_USER_IDS=7544007323
ADMIN_USERNAMES=shreyansh,admin
ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@brainy.study

# ── 4. Supabase Integration (REST API & RLS) ─────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

# ── 5. Google OAuth 2.0 Credentials ──────────────────────────────────
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_oauth_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ── 6. Telegram Bot Integration ──────────────────────────────────────
TELEGRAM_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here
OWNER_ID=7544007323

# ── 7. Multi-Provider AI Keys (Automatic Routing & Fallbacks) ────────
# Groq (Primary high-speed Llama 3.3 70B & DeepSeek reasoning)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here
# GROQ_API_KEY_1=gsk_...
# GROQ_API_KEY_2=gsk_...

# Google Gemini (Reasoning & STEM problem solving)
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# GEMINI_API_KEY_1=AIzaSy...

# OpenRouter (DeepSeek R1 / V3 fallback)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...

# Tavily (Real-time live search grounding)
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...

# ── 8. Rate Limiting & 5-Hour Quota Configuration ────────────────────
GLOBAL_MESSAGE_LIMIT=30
QUOTA_WINDOW_HOURS=5
